  "reasoning": "The defendants (the company and its legal representative) used a forged recommendation letter in the name of a government office to enable a company without proper qualifications to conduct oil extraction, which constitutes falsification of state documents (伪造国家机关公文、证件、印章罪). They also paid a bribe of 200,000 yuan to a public official to obtain this advantage, which is the crime of bribery (行贿). Moreover, the activity enabled is illegal oil extraction without the required mining permits, which falls under illegal mining (非法采矿罪). Therefore, the appropriate charges are bribery, forgery of official documents, and illegal mining.",
